<title>POLAND: REMAK TURNS TO PROFIT IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>REMAK TURNS TO PROFIT IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		   1997		1996</p>
